WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.001
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.001 --> 00:00:03.002
This is "Late Night."

00:00:03.002 --> 00:00:04.170
We hope you're
doing well tonight

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:05.438
and, now, we are going
to get to the news.

00:00:05.438 --> 00:00:07.573
President Biden is set on Monday

00:00:07.573 --> 00:00:10.376
to sign the bipartisan
infrastructure bill into law,

00:00:10.376 --> 00:00:13.246
provided they can get
Joe Manchin off of it.

00:00:13.246 --> 00:00:14.814
[ Laughter ]

00:00:14.814 --> 00:00:16.850
After New Hampshire
Governor Chris Sununu

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:20.352
announced this week that he will
not run next year for Senate,

00:00:20.352 --> 00:00:23.156
Minority Leader Mitch McConnell
is reportedly upset

00:00:23.156 --> 00:00:25.291
that Sununu did not give him
advance notice

00:00:25.291 --> 00:00:27.359
or -- hear me out --

00:00:27.359 --> 00:00:28.495
that's just how he looks.

00:00:28.495 --> 00:00:30.329
[ Laughter ]

00:00:30.329 --> 00:00:32.665
That photo was taken
at Six Flags.

00:00:32.665 --> 00:00:35.034
[ Laughter ]

00:00:35.034 --> 00:00:36.902 line:0%
During their virtual summit
next week,

00:00:36.902 --> 00:00:39.639 line:0%
Chinese, President Xi Jinping
is reportedly expected

00:00:39.639 --> 00:00:43.209 line:0%
to invite President Biden to the
2022 Beijing Winter Olympics,

00:00:43.209 --> 00:00:46.312 line:0%
but, for his part,
Biden says he'll only go

00:00:46.312 --> 00:00:47.647 line:0%
if he qualifies.

00:00:47.647 --> 00:00:49.682
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.682 --> 00:00:52.618
According a new poll,
76% of Americans said

00:00:52.618 --> 00:00:54.787
that Facebook
makes society worse.

00:00:54.787 --> 00:00:57.690
Said Zuckerberg, "Right,
but what do you think of Meta?"

00:00:57.690 --> 00:00:59.692
[ Laughter ]

00:00:59.692 --> 00:01:02.495
Apple CEO Tim Cook said,
in an interview this week,

00:01:02.495 --> 00:01:04.764
that he's worried
about the amount of time

00:01:04.764 --> 00:01:07.833
people spend "scrolling
mindlessly" on their devices,

00:01:07.833 --> 00:01:10.803
which is kind of like hearing
that your weed dealer

00:01:10.803 --> 00:01:12.405
is worried you sleep too much.

00:01:12.405 --> 00:01:14.640
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:17.076
The Canadian fast-food chain
Tim Hortons announced

00:01:17.076 --> 00:01:19.178
a collaboration
with pop star Justin Bieber

00:01:19.178 --> 00:01:21.680
to launch three new flavors
of doughnut holes.

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:23.716
When they first come out,
they'll be cute,

00:01:23.716 --> 00:01:25.751
but then, they'll become
really annoying.

00:01:25.751 --> 00:01:27.453
[ Laughter ]
Then, all of a sudden,

00:01:27.453 --> 00:01:28.521
you'll be like, "Wait a minute.

00:01:28.521 --> 00:01:30.723
Are these doughnut holes
actually good?"

00:01:30.723 --> 00:01:33.092
[ Laughter ]
Before realizing you are

00:01:33.092 --> 00:01:34.427
way too old to be enjoying them.

00:01:34.427 --> 00:01:36.462
[ Laughter ]

00:01:36.462 --> 00:01:38.531
A 105-year-old runner,

00:01:38.531 --> 00:01:41.634
Julia "Hurricane" Hawkins,
recently set a world record

00:01:41.634 --> 00:01:44.136
in the 100-meter dash
for her age group.

00:01:44.136 --> 00:01:46.371
The new record is eight meters.

00:01:46.371 --> 00:01:49.476
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:55.048 --> 00:01:57.617
I'm totally fine
with your reaction.

00:01:57.617 --> 00:01:59.351
[ Laughter ]

00:01:59.351 --> 00:02:01.821
According to new reports,
reality star Kim Kardashian's

00:02:01.821 --> 00:02:03.857
shapewear brand SKIMS'
collaboration

00:02:03.857 --> 00:02:06.025
with the luxury
fashion brand Fendi

00:02:06.025 --> 00:02:07.426
sold out in just one minute,

00:02:07.426 --> 00:02:09.529
continuing the Kardashian
family trend

00:02:09.529 --> 00:02:10.930
of immediately selling out.

00:02:10.930 --> 00:02:12.264
[ Laughter ]

00:02:12.264 --> 00:02:14.501
And, finally, today is

00:02:14.501 --> 00:02:17.336
actor Leonardo DiCaprio's
47th birthday

00:02:17.336 --> 00:02:18.771
and, when he blew out
the candles,

00:02:18.771 --> 00:02:20.873
he was still Leonardo DiCaprio.

00:02:20.873 --> 00:02:23.209
[ Laughter ]
"Hey, I got my wish!"

00:02:23.209 --> 00:02:25.411
And that, you guys,
was a monologue.

